# Benchmarks levels, transcribed from the Tech Charts weekly PDF.
#
# Held back deliberately rather than forgotten. This repository is public and
# its history is permanent, and this file is a subscription publication's
# analysis for thirty-five instruments, refreshed weekly — a different order of
# thing from the handful of levels in watchlist.json. Publishing it is a call
# about someone else's paid work, so it is the owner's to make, not a side
# effect of building the page. The page handles the file being absent and says
# so. To publish, delete this line and commit the file.
docs/data/benchmarks.json
